# Engine rules

- Effects write **intensity 0..1** only; color/rainbow/glow live in `colorize` / renderer — not effect files.
- Reuse `Float32Array` buffers; no allocate-per-frame.
- `TextBitmap` column-major: `index = x * height + y`.
- Registry pattern: `createEffect(id)`; UI lists registered ids only.
- Switching: text / effectId / matrixSizeId / direction → dispose → rebuild bitmap if needed → init → `t = 0`. Color/speed/glow → do not reset `t`.
- Flatten `\n` before raster. Threshold default `> 128` (tune 100–160). Missing glyph → `?`.
- MUST NOT import React components or read DOM from effects.
- Direction convention (`04`): rtl/ltr/ttb/btt as scroll content movement.
- Unit-test pure math (marquee/fade/blink/flatten) per `14`.
